{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t食環署今年頭十個月，接獲約11000宗鼠患投訴，相當於往年全年的總和。<br/>\n<br/>\n署方說，除了環境因素，傳媒廣泛報道，帶動公眾關注。署方近期核查超過1300個地點，捕獲超過100隻活鼠。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:54.676133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:39:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:21:00.492153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:26.637363+00:00","content_hash":"f11d18793bedd17d75e2c6f4e3f7ce6e124a680ffb2ca9abbc6d7c0ce2f306a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}